From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:08:08 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] overlay/cross-compile: drop invalid makeBinaryWrapper
 override

makeBinaryWrapper is a binary package, not a stdenv-parameterized derivation; overriding it with stdenv was invalid. Keep the targeted GCC stdenv patch, but leave makeBinaryWrapper alone. The systemd 257 legacy build remains blocked by the GCC 16.2.0 libgomp failure.
---
 overlay/cross-compile.nix | 4 ----
 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/overlay/cross-compile.nix b/overlay/cross-compile.nix
index 53820322..c70ace44 100644
--- a/overlay/cross-compile.nix
+++ b/overlay/cross-compile.nix
@@ -85,10 +85,6 @@ else
     inherit systemd257;
     systemd_latest-oldkernel = systemd262OldKernel;
 
-    makeBinaryWrapper = super.makeBinaryWrapper.override {
-      stdenv = systemdStdenv;
-    };
-
     # ModemManager's generated GDBus sources race with the static archive link
     # when building in parallel; serialize its build.
     modemmanager = super.modemmanager.overrideAttrs (old: {
